<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MOSTLY UNCHANGED.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MOSTLY UNCHANGED.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were</p>
<p>largely unchanged at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Thursday. The six-month rate inched one bps higher to 3.18 pct.</p>
<p>				    June 12 fix	  June 11 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.00 pct	     3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.02 pct	     3.02 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.06 pct	     3.06 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.18 pct	     3.17 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.27 pct	     3.27 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.37 pct	     3.37 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
